 **Data Structures:**
-- Color vectors are 3-element arrays/tuples.
-- YCoCg space: $[Y, Co, Cg]^T$.
-- YCrCb space: $[Y, Cr, Cb]^T$.
+- Color vectors are 3-element arrays/tuples [G].
+- YCoCg space: $[Y, Co, Cg]^T$ [S1, unofficial].
